From 7f16801d4d3e52a538fb365150918da227498c83 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fujii Hironori <fujii@igalia.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 18:09:46 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Don't put a web process that has not committed any
 meaningful load in the WebProcessCache

The site of a web process is set when a navigation starts in it, so a process can have a site although it never
committed a load other than about: URLs: its provisional navigation failed or was cancelled, or the navigation from the
initial about:blank page was moved to another process because of a Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy browsing context group
switch (x.com, youtube.com). When such a process became unused (for example when the back/forward cache entry of its
about:blank page was evicted or expired), it was kept in the WebProcessCache for up to 5 minutes (GLib ports) with its GPU memory
although it holds nothing of its site.

Don't cache a non-shared process that has not committed any meaningful (non-about:) load, so it exits instead. Such
processes left over from failed or cancelled provisional navigations are no longer cached either, so a later navigation
to their site uses a new process.

* Source/WebKit/UIProcess/WebProcessCache.cpp:
(WebKit::WebProcessCache::canCacheProcess const):
---
 Source/WebKit/UIProcess/WebProcessCache.cpp | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Source/WebKit/UIProcess/WebProcessCache.cpp b/Source/WebKit/UIProcess/WebProcessCache.cpp
index c8f3d17fdbcd..e7b36a39c156 100644
--- a/Source/WebKit/UIProcess/WebProcessCache.cpp
+++ b/Source/WebKit/UIProcess/WebProcessCache.cpp
@@ -107,6 +107,15 @@ bool WebProcessCache::canCacheProcess(WebProcessProxy& process) const
         return false;
     }
 
+    // The site of a process is set when a navigation starts, so a process may have a site without having committed any
+    // load other than about: URLs, e.g. when its provisional navigation failed or was cancelled, or when the navigation
+    // from the initial about:blank page was moved to another process because of a Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy header.
+    // Such a process has nothing of its site worth keeping.
+    if (!process.isSharedProcess() && !process.hasCommittedAnyMeaningfulProvisionalLoads()) {
+        WEBPROCESSCACHE_RELEASE_LOG("canCacheProcess: Not caching process because it has not committed any meaningful load", process.processID());
+        return false;
+    }
+
     if (RefPtr websiteDataStore = process.websiteDataStore()) {
